{{also|Appendix:Variations of "dan"}}
==Turkish==

===Suffix===
'''-dan'''

# Used to form ablative of nouns.
#: ''[[okul]] - [[okuldan]]''
#:: school - from school

===Usage notes===
* It's used when the noun's last vowel is a back vowel. 
* It could be "[[-den]]", when the noun's last vowel is a front vowel.
*: ''[[köy]] - [[köyden]]''
* It could be "[[-tan]]", when the noun's last consonant is "f", "s", "t", "k", "ç", "ş", "h" or "p".
*: ''[[mutfak]] - [[mutfaktan]]''
* It must be used with an [[apostrophe]] while forming a proper noun.
*: ''[[İstanbul]] - [[İstanbul'dan]]''

